    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but isn't that kind of a slippery slope though? if we say that \"broadening the standard\" means technical skill doesn't matter as much as the \"message,\" doesn't that just mean anyone with a strong opinion can call themselves an artist regardless of their ability? it feels like we're trading actual talent and beauty for just... loud opinions. don't you think that's a net loss for culture?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
