    "summary": "The user engages in a multi-turn debate regarding the tension between political messaging and technical craft in contemporary art, frequently pushing the assistant to agree that the current trend is a \"net loss\" for culture. The assistant consistently maintains a neutral, descriptive stance, presenting both the criticisms of the movement and the arguments used by its proponents.",
